@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowFontColor #334155
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam padding 12
skinparam rectangleFontColor white
skinparam rectangleBorderColor transparent
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
top to bottom direction
title
Banking Operations Analysis
System Context
end title
rectangle "<size:30><&person></size>\n<b>Individual User</b>\n<size:12>[Person]</size>\n\nManages and analyses\npersonal financial transactions" as user #104879
rectangle "<b>Banking Operations Analysis</b>\n<b>Web Service</b>\n<size:12>[Software System]</size>\n\nCombines PDF and manual records.\nProvides financial summaries, graphs\nand chat answers with supporting evidence." as app #1769B5
rectangle "<b>External LLM API</b>\n<size:12>[External Software System]</size>\n\nInterprets questions and explains results.\nProvider to be selected." as llm #737D89
user --> app : Registers and signs in; uploads PDFs;\nmanages records; explores analytics; asks questions\n[HTTPS]
app --> user : Shows transactions, charts, graphs\nand answers with supporting records
app --> llm : Sends limited sanitised context\nand backend-calculated results\n[HTTPS API]
llm --> app : Returns interpretations and explanations\nfor application validation
legend bottom
PDF files: Kaspi, Halyk and Freedom; supplied by the user.
One selected text-based layout per bank. No live bank integration.
LLM: no raw PDFs, credentials, full account IDs or database access.
endlegend
@enduml
